@startuml
title Staged FLT Parse Pipeline
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Nouveau Rholang parser" as Host #DBEAFE
rectangle "Structural FltTemplate\nchunks · HoleIds · provenance" as Template #FEF3C7
rectangle "Lexical installed-handle\ncapability" as Handle #FBCFE8
rectangle "Bounded token lattice\nholes are typed terminals" as Lattice #DCFCE7
rectangle "Installed WPDA\nall readings · exact weights" as Guest #A7F3D0
rectangle "Witness-coupled SPPF" as Forest #BFDBFE
rectangle "Scoped FLT\nhandle · category · telescope" as AST #E0E7FF

Host --> Template : capture only
Template --> Lattice : evaluation-time staging
Handle --> Lattice : Parse + Construct/Match
Lattice --> Guest : bounded input
Guest --> Forest : preserve alternatives
Forest --> AST : complete unambiguous result

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Existing Rholang host parser |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Structural surface template |
  |<#FBCFE8> | Unforgeable installed handle |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Structural token boundary |
  |<#A7F3D0> | Fail-closed WPDA gate |
  |<#BFDBFE> | Shared packed parse forest |
  |<#E0E7FF> | Scoped FLT value |
endlegend
@enduml
